TITLE Scenario 7506: pH=7.5, Medium, NTA=300mg/L, Clay, Mesic, Ionic=Medium
SOLUTION 1  RI contaminated soil pore water
    temp      25
    pH        7.5
    pe        8
    units     mol/L
    # Heavy metals
    Pb        4.8263e-04  # 100 mg/L
    Cu        1.2589e-03  # 80 mg/L
    Zn        1.8354e-03  # 120 mg/L
    Cd        7.1168e-05  # 8 mg/L
    # Competing cations
    Ca        2.4950e-03  # 100 mg/L
    Mg        2.0568e-03  # 50 mg/L
    # Ionic strength (salinity)
    Na        2.1749e-02  # 500 mg/L
    Cl        1.9746e-02  # 700 mg/L
    # Dissolved organic carbon
    C(4)      1.9305e-04  # 40 mg/L base DOC
    Nta       1.5695e-03  # 300 mg/L NTA
    
SURFACE 1  Soil mineral surfaces (Fe/Al oxides)
    Hfo_wOH   1.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
